## What changed

- Sign-off fills the PR template at 5.4 and publishes it at 5.8.
- A read-only check validates the filled description.

## Why the change

- Reviewers had to open the spec folder to judge a Sign-off PR.

## Why this approach

A fixed template filled from evidence the spec folder already holds needs no new dependency.

## Special things to note

None.

## How to test

1. Run tests/run-all.sh --suite scripts/check-pr-body.
2. Confirm every case passes.

